{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14915","headline":"新移北厅因贻同院诸公兼呈畅博士 · 卢纶","name":"新移北厅因贻同院诸公兼呈畅博士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华轩迩台座，顾影忝时伦。\n弱质偃弥旷，清风来亦频。\n恩辉坐凌迈，景物恣芳新。\n终乃愧吾友，无容私此身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}